{"title":"메피스토","artist":"여왕벌","sourceId":"reference:2A3noQoX9OHRQZl4jIry","sourceHash":"107d55a8e7b6881bcbc72dfc70fa516f428a3d8e531be5d9bcb244c59c7feb4b","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":30.45,"end":33.45,"text":"ラストチャンスに飢えたつま先が","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":33.91,"end":36.9,"text":"踊り出すまま駆けたこの夜空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":36.9,"end":39.5,"text":"並のスタンスじゃ靡かない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":39.5,"end":42.5,"text":"星は宝石の憧れ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":43.45,"end":46.45,"text":"浮かぶ涙と汗は血の名残り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":46.52,"end":49.52,"text":"目の中でしか泳げなきゃ芝居","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":49.75,"end":52.26,"text":"だけどステージが逃がさない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":52.26,"end":55.26,"text":"いついつまでも憧れ　焦がれているよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":57.63,"end":60.57,"text":"I’ve never seen such a liar","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":60.57,"end":63.57,"text":"生まれつきたっての底なし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":63.85,"end":66.85,"text":"This lie is love. And this lie is a gift to the world","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":67.43,"end":70.43,"text":"誰と生きたか思い出して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":70.82,"end":73.82,"text":"わたしが命を賭けるから　あげるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":77.16,"end":80.16,"text":"あなたは時間をくれたのでしょう？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":82.33,"end":85.33,"text":"あらゆる望みの総てを叶えたら　ああ果たせたら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":89.99,"end":92.53999999999999,"text":"あなたに会いたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":92.53999999999999,"end":95.53999999999999,"text":"星に願いをかけて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":96.28999999999999,"end":99.24000000000001,"text":"戻れないから大切にするの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":99.24000000000001,"end":102.24000000000001,"text":"始めないなら高を括れるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":102.55,"end":105.08,"text":"らくになる日はまず来ない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":105.08,"end":108.08,"text":"日々のなかに集まる悲しい光","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":113.39,"end":116.39,"text":"生まれつきだってば底なし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":116.68,"end":119.68,"text":"This lie is love. And this lie is a gift to the world","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":120.23,"end":123.23,"text":"誰を生きたか忘れちゃった！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":149.21,"end":152.21,"text":"あなたに命が戻るなら　届くなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":155.61,"end":158.61,"text":"わたしはどうなろうと構わないのに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":161.92000000000002,"end":164.92000000000002,"text":"どうやら総ては叶わない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":166.27,"end":169.27,"text":"叶わないならばあなたになりたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":170.95,"end":172.95,"text":"星は砕け光る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":172.95,"end":175.95,"text":"わたしが命を賭けるから　あげるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":179.54,"end":182.54,"text":"あなたは時間をくれたのでしょう？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":184.71,"end":187.71,"text":"あらゆる望みの総てを叶えたら　ああ果たせたら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":192.24,"end":194.96,"text":"あなたに会いたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":194.96,"end":197.79,"text":"星に願いをかけて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":197.79,"end":200.79,"text":"さあ星の子たちよ　よくお眠りなさい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":204.53,"end":207.53,"text":"輝きは鈍らない　あなたたちならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":210.7,"end":213.7,"text":"さあ星の子たちよ　よく狙いなさい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":217.22,"end":220.22,"text":"またたきを許さない　あなたたちならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}